time=2026-10-27T03:33:15.771Z level=INFO msg="model prompt" record=prov-2026-15f42a00 attempt=1 prompt="## The change\n\nThe provenance evidence refresh command (blueprint prov-2026-f90f5a04), in three files.\n\nWiring (cobra package):\n- cmd/provenance/evidence_cmd.go: a top-level group (createGroup), command evidence, use \"evidence\", short \"Work with a record's verification evidence\", arity none.\n- cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_cmd.go: a subcommand of evidence (createSubcommand, parent evidence, command evidence-refresh), use \"refresh [id]\", short \"Append fresh evidence to an implemented record without a new version\", arity max_one. Flags, none with a short form or default:\n  - record (string): \"Record to refresh (or give it as the argument)\"\n  - reason (string): \"Why the evidence is refreshed (printed in the output)\"\n\nLogic, cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go (go package, package main). An implemented record with evidence whose content_hash and spec hashes still match is re-verified by running its associated specs; on success fresh evidence is appended (runner \"provenance evidence refresh\", carrying the current content and spec hashes) with no version bump and the record file untouched; a moved content or spec hash is refused (revise or edit --refresh-specs is the path); a failing spec writes nothing. Evidence.Store.Append disambiguates files written in the same second itself. \nImports, each its own addImport, exactly these: fmt, io, os, path/filepath, strings, time, github.com/spf13/cobra, github.com/livecodelife/provenance/evidence, github.com/livecodelife/provenance/record.\n\nDeclarations, in this order, each exactly one set* call whose code kwarg is the code below verbatim (gofmt-formatted, comments kept). Do not alter, reorder or add anything.\n\n  - setFunction name refreshEvidence, code exactly:\n      func refreshEvidence(out io.Writer, r *repo, id, reason string) error {\n      \trec, _, err := r.Store.Load(id)\n      \tif err != nil {\n      \t\treturn err\n      \t}\n      \tif rec.Status != record.StatusImplemented {\n      \t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"%s is %s: only an implemented record's evidence is refreshed (use provenance complete)\", id, rec.Status)\n      \t}\n      \tstore := &evidence.Store{Root: r.Root, Dir: r.Config.Dir}\n      \tlatest, err := store.Latest(rec.ID, rec.Version)\n      \tif err != nil {\n      \t\treturn err\n      \t}\n      \tif latest == nil {\n      \t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"%s has no evidence for version %d to refresh: run provenance complete or revise it first\", id, rec.Version)\n      \t}\n      \tbehind := behindSet(r)\n      \tverdict := evidence.Check(latest, currentEvidence(r, rec, behind))\n      \tvar moved []string\n      \tfor _, why := range verdict.Reasons {\n      \t\tif why == \"content\" || why == \"specs\" {\n      \t\t\tmoved = append(moved, why)\n      \t\t}\n      \t}\n      \tif len(moved) > 0 {\n      \t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"%s changed since its latest evidence (%s): use provenance revise or edit --refresh-specs, not a refresh\", id, strings.Join(moved, \", \"))\n      \t}\n      \tran, failed, _ := runRecordSpecs(out, r, rec, nil)\n      \tif !ran {\n      \t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"%s has no runnable associated specs to refresh its evidence with\", id)\n      \t}\n      \tif failed {\n      \t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"%s: associated specs failed; no evidence was written\", id)\n      \t}\n      \tbefore := evidenceFiles(r, rec.ID)\n      \tcur := currentEvidence(r, rec, behind)\n      \tfresh := evidence.New(rec, cur, true, time.Now().UTC().Format(time.RFC3339), \"provenance evidence refresh\")\n      \tif err := store.Append(fresh); err != nil {\n      \t\treturn err\n      \t}\n      \tvar added []string\n      \tfor f := range evidenceFiles(r, rec.ID) {\n      \t\tif !before[f] {\n      \t\t\tadded = append(added, f)\n      \t\t}\n      \t}\n      \tif r.Config.CommitOnStatusChange {\n      \t\tvar paths []string\n      \t\tfor _, f := range added {\n      \t\t\tif rel, err := filepath.Rel(r.Root, f); err == nil {\n      \t\t\t\tpaths = append(paths, rel)\n      \t\t\t}\n      \t\t}\n      \t\tif err := r.commit(\"Refresh evidence of \"+rec.ID+\" \"+tag(rec.ID, rec.Version), paths...); err != nil {\n      \t\t\tfor _, f := range added {\n      \t\t\t\tos.Remove(f)\n      \t\t\t}\n      \t\t\tr.unstage(paths...)\n      \t\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"%s: the auto-commit was rejected: %w\", id, err)\n      \t\t}\n      \t}\n      \tnow := evidence.Check(fresh, cur)\n      \tfmt.Fprintf(out, \"\\n✓ Refreshed evidence of %s@%d (%s)\\n\", rec.ID, rec.Version, now.State)\n      \tif reason != \"\" {\n      \t\tfmt.Fprintf(out, \"  Reason: %s\\n\", reason)\n      \t}\n      \tfmt.Fprint(out, \"  No new version was written; the record is unchanged.\\n\\n\")\n      \treturn nil\n      }\n  - setFunction name runEvidenceRefresh, code exactly:\n      func runEvidenceRefresh(out io.Writer, cmd *cobra.Command, args []string) error {\n      \tr, err := openRepo(cmd)\n      \tif err != nil {\n      \t\treturn err\n      \t}\n      \treason, _ := cmd.Flags().GetString(\"reason\")\n      \tid, err := recordArg(cmd, args)\n      \tif err != nil {\n      \t\treturn err\n      \t}\n      \trec, _, err := r.resolve(id)\n      \tif err != nil {\n      \t\treturn err\n      \t}\n      \tids := []string{rec.ID}\n      \tfailed := 0\n      \tfor _, id := range ids {\n      \t\tif err := refreshEvidence(out, r, id, reason); err != nil {\n      \t\t\tfailed++\n      \t\t\tfmt.Fprintf(out, \"\\n✗ %v\\n\\n\", err)\n      \t\t}\n      \t}\n      \tif failed > 0 {\n      \t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"%d of %d records could not be refreshed\", failed, len(ids))\n      \t}\n      \treturn nil\n      }\n\n## Constraints on it\n\n- TestEvidenceRefreshKeepsTheVersion, TestEvidenceRefreshRefusals and TestEvidenceRefreshNotImplemented pass; a second grow makes no model call.\n\n## Supplementary context\n\nThis section is supplied by the caller, not by the record. It is advisory: it does not add to or change what the record authorized, and the files below remain the only ones the actions may reach.\n\nCaller notes:\n\nSelect every invocation this record declares, in all its files (cmd/provenance/evidence_cmd.go, evidence_refresh_cmd.go and evidence_refresh_run.go): every addImport, addFlag, setFunction and wiring invocation the record states, so no region is dropped. The record no longer has an `all` flag and no codeOnlyStale function: do not declare them. Follow the record's text and code as written, with nothing added.\n\nSelections made for this change on an earlier run (context only; they are not applied):\n\n- {\"action\":\"setArgs\",\"kwargs\":{\"arity\":\"none\",\"bin\":\"provenance\",\"command\":\"evidence\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"setArgs\",\"kwargs\":{\"arity\":\"max_one\",\"bin\":\"provenance\",\"command\":\"evidence-refresh\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addFlag\",\"kwargs\":{\"bin\":\"provenance\",\"command\":\"evidence-refresh\",\"flag\":\"record\",\"type\":\"string\",\"usage\":\"Record to refresh (or give it as the argument)\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addFlag\",\"kwargs\":{\"bin\":\"provenance\",\"command\":\"evidence-refresh\",\"flag\":\"reason\",\"type\":\"string\",\"usage\":\"Why the evidence is refreshed (printed in the output)\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addFlag\",\"kwargs\":{\"bin\":\"provenance\",\"command\":\"evidence-refresh\",\"flag\":\"all\",\"type\":\"bool\",\"usage\":\"Refresh every implemented record that is stale only because its code moved\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addImport\",\"kwargs\":{\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"path\":\"fmt\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addImport\",\"kwargs\":{\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"path\":\"io\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addImport\",\"kwargs\":{\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"path\":\"os\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addImport\",\"kwargs\":{\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"path\":\"path/filepath\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addImport\",\"kwargs\":{\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"path\":\"strings\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addImport\",\"kwargs\":{\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"path\":\"time\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addImport\",\"kwargs\":{\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"path\":\"github.com/spf13/cobra\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addImport\",\"kwargs\":{\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"path\":\"github.com/livecodelife/provenance/evidence\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"addImport\",\"kwargs\":{\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"path\":\"github.com/livecodelife/provenance/record\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"setFunction\",\"kwargs\":{\"code\":\"func codeOnlyStale(row evidenceRow) bool {\\n\\tif row.State != string(evidence.Stale) {\\n\\t\\treturn false\\n\\t}\\n\\thasCode := false\\n\\tfor _, reason := range row.Reasons {\\n\\t\\tswitch reason {\\n\\t\\tcase \\\"content\\\", \\\"specs\\\", \\\"parent\\\":\\n\\t\\t\\treturn false\\n\\t\\tcase \\\"code\\\":\\n\\t\\t\\thasCode = true\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t}\\n\\treturn hasCode\\n}\",\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"name\":\"codeOnlyStale\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"setFunction\",\"kwargs\":{\"code\":\"func refreshEvidence(out io.Writer, r *repo, id, reason string) error {\\n\\trec, _, err := r.Store.Load(id)\\n\\tif err != nil {\\n\\t\\treturn err\\n\\t}\\n\\tif rec.Status != record.StatusImplemented {\\n\\t\\treturn fmt.Errorf(\\\"%s is %s: only an implemented record's evidence is refreshed (use provenance complete)\\\", id, rec.Status)\\n\\t}\\n\\tstore := \\u0026evidence.Store{Root: r.Root, Dir: r.Config.Dir}\\n\\tlatest, err := store.Latest(rec.ID, rec.Version)\\n\\tif err != nil {\\n\\t\\treturn err\\n\\t}\\n\\tif latest == nil {\\n\\t\\treturn fmt.Errorf(\\\"%s has no evidence for version %d to refresh: run provenance complete or revise it first\\\", id, rec.Version)\\n\\t}\\n\\tbehind := behindSet(r)\\n\\tverdict := evidence.Check(latest, currentEvidence(r, rec, behind))\\n\\tvar moved []string\\n\\tfor _, why := range verdict.Reasons {\\n\\t\\tif why == \\\"content\\\" || why == \\\"specs\\\" {\\n\\t\\t\\tmoved = append(moved, why)\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t}\\n\\tif len(moved) \\u003e 0 {\\n\\t\\treturn fmt.Errorf(\\\"%s changed since its latest evidence (%s): use provenance revise or edit --refresh-specs, not a refresh\\\", id, strings.Join(moved, \\\", \\\"))\\n\\t}\\n\\tran, failed, _ := runRecordSpecs(out, r, rec, nil)\\n\\tif !ran {\\n\\t\\treturn fmt.Errorf(\\\"%s has no runnable associated specs to refresh its evidence with\\\", id)\\n\\t}\\n\\tif failed {\\n\\t\\treturn fmt.Errorf(\\\"%s: associated specs failed; no evidence was written\\\", id)\\n\\t}\\n\\tbefore := evidenceFiles(r, rec.ID)\\n\\tcur := currentEvidence(r, rec, behind)\\n\\tfresh := evidence.New(rec, cur, true, time.Now().UTC().Format(time.RFC3339), \\\"provenance evidence refresh\\\")\\n\\tif err := store.Append(fresh); err != nil {\\n\\t\\treturn err\\n\\t}\\n\\tvar added []string\\n\\tfor f := range evidenceFiles(r, rec.ID) {\\n\\t\\tif !before[f] {\\n\\t\\t\\tadded = append(added, f)\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t}\\n\\tif r.Config.CommitOnStatusChange {\\n\\t\\tvar paths []string\\n\\t\\tfor _, f := range added {\\n\\t\\t\\tif rel, err := filepath.Rel(r.Root, f); err == nil {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tpaths = append(paths, rel)\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\tif err := r.commit(\\\"Refresh evidence of \\\"+rec.ID+\\\" \\\"+tag(rec.ID, rec.Version), paths...); err != nil {\\n\\t\\t\\tfor _, f := range added {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tos.Remove(f)\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\tr.unstage(paths...)\\n\\t\\t\\treturn fmt.Errorf(\\\"%s: the auto-commit was rejected: %w\\\", id, err)\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t}\\n\\tnow := evidence.Check(fresh, cur)\\n\\tfmt.Fprintf(out, \\\"\\\\n✓ Refreshed evidence of %s@%d (%s)\\\\n\\\", rec.ID, rec.Version, now.State)\\n\\tif reason != \\\"\\\" {\\n\\t\\tfmt.Fprintf(out, \\\"  Reason: %s\\\\n\\\", reason)\\n\\t}\\n\\tfmt.Fprint(out, \\\"  No new version was written; the record is unchanged.\\\\n\\\\n\\\")\\n\\treturn nil\\n}\",\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"name\":\"refreshEvidence\"}}\n- {\"action\":\"setFunction\",\"kwargs\":{\"code\":\"func runEvidenceRefresh(out io.Writer, cmd *cobra.Command, args []string) error {\\n\\tr, err := openRepo(cmd)\\n\\tif err != nil {\\n\\t\\treturn err\\n\\t}\\n\\tall, _ := cmd.Flags().GetBool(\\\"all\\\")\\n\\treason, _ := cmd.Flags().GetString(\\\"reason\\\")\\n\\tvar ids []string\\n\\tif all {\\n\\t\\trows, err := checkEvidence(r)\\n\\t\\tif err != nil {\\n\\t\\t\\treturn err\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\tfor _, row := range rows {\\n\\t\\t\\tif codeOnlyStale(row) {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tids = append(ids, row.ID)\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\tif len(ids) == 0 {\\n\\t\\t\\tfmt.Fprint(out, \\\"\\\\n✓ Nothing to refresh: no implemented record is stale only because its code moved\\\\n\\\\n\\\")\\n\\t\\t\\treturn nil\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t} else {\\n\\t\\tid, err := recordArg(cmd, args)\\n\\t\\tif err != nil {\\n\\t\\t\\treturn err\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\trec, _, err := r.resolve(id)\\n\\t\\tif err != nil {\\n\\t\\t\\treturn err\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\tids = []string{rec.ID}\\n\\t}\\n\\tfailed := 0\\n\\tfor _, id := range ids {\\n\\t\\tif err := refreshEvidence(out, r, id, reason); err != nil {\\n\\t\\t\\tfailed++\\n\\t\\t\\tfmt.Fprintf(out, \\\"\\\\n✗ %v\\\\n\\\\n\\\", err)\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t}\\n\\tif failed \\u003e 0 {\\n\\t\\treturn fmt.Errorf(\\\"%d of %d records could not be refreshed\\\", failed, len(ids))\\n\\t}\\n\\treturn nil\\n}\",\"file\":\"cmd/provenance/evidence_refresh_run.go\",\"name\":\"runEvidenceRefresh\"}}\n\n## Already present\n\nThese regions already exist in the files below and belong to other changes. Do not select them: an action that resolves to one of them would conflict with the change that owns it.\n\n- cmd/provenance/main.go: describeRoot {\"bin\":\"provenance\"} (owned by prov-2026-76a125e6; do not select)\n- cmd/provenance/main.go: addShortPersistentFlag:string {\"bin\":\"provenance\",\"flag\